{"name": "r1102b-B5", "sha256": "6b76c4b3180a1b92afe70b4f73f437350e22dcb3e548e902f0fb339c8f89d221", "words": 70, "headline": "Human Written", "prediction_short": "Human", "fraction_ai": 7.526674620184924e-23, "fraction_ai_assisted": 2.896236236182899e-20, "fraction_human": 1.0, "version": "4.1", "source": "new", "dashboard_link": "https://www.pangram.com/history/639ffbea-7d4a-4d96-b18a-8bd8f3f2eb27", "utc": "2026-11-02T17:21:36Z", "windows": [["Human Written", "High", 76, 0, 433, "Make the hypnosis more alert\nAside from focusing on things in your direct experience, you can also suggest yourself into greater alertness (it's still relaxed-alert, not paranoid-alert). Keep your eyes open. Use a small hand movement each time you make the auto-suggestion that you're gaining increasing clarity. Then stop the hand movement and see where your mind is at. That hand movement is the mental escape into the body's flow."]]}
{"name": "r1102b-B6", "sha256": "272f01e9b40e4a93d0de08a07fd5e27f06165c65bec8e2313578a887699f83ae", "words": 262, "headline": "Human Written", "prediction_short": "Human", "fraction_ai": 4.671717162762181e-18, "fraction_ai_assisted": 3.3668777709185634e-20, "fraction_human": 1.0, "version": "4.1", "source": "new", "dashboard_link": "https://www.pangram.com/history/cfcddebd-617e-43cc-9cec-5db49b7c12d4", "utc": "2026-11-02T17:21:43Z", "windows": [["Human Written", "High", 135, 0, 700, "Once you’ve got your bearings, make your first wish.\n\"Please show me the next truth. The next symbol or feeling. The question or action that's useful for me at this time, and no more than I can handle.\"\nStay awake when your mind likes to escape\nIf your mind keeps drifting off, sit up and open your eyes. Then feel your feet on the floor, and just let your breathing go at its own pace. Tell yourself, \"I'm not going anywhere. I'm happily arriving more fully here each moment.\"\nPick something in the room to look at, and feel your spine at the same time (focusing on two things makes it harder for the mind to use multitasking mode to wander). Then ask yourself what the daydreaming is doing for you."], ["Human Written", "Medium", 5, 700, 729, " Is it bringing you guidance?"], ["Human Written", "High", 133, 729, 1455, " Does it help you work through a feeling, or are you using it to avoid something?\nAsk for any diffuse benefits to become more practically focused: \"If this is guidance, show me what I need to do about it. If I'm avoiding something, bring me gently back to the present and show me what it is.\"\nMake the hypnosis more alert\nAside from focusing on things in your direct experience, you can also suggest yourself into greater alertness (it's still relaxed-alert, not paranoid-alert). Keep your eyes open. Use a small hand movement each time you make the auto-suggestion that you're gaining increasing clarity. Then stop the hand movement and see where your mind is at. That hand movement is the mental escape into the body's flow."]]}
